    bestMonths: [3, 4, 5, 9, 10],
    bestTimeBlurb: "Visit in {months}: travel guides favour autumn for harvest activity and mild weather, spring brings budding vines and the biggest crowds, and heavy rain and storms are more common in summer and autumn.",
